/F1 9.5 Tf
(4.12 Temporomandibular joint \(TMJ\) disorders. This plan covers diagnosis and medically necessary treatment of) Tj
T*
(temporomandibular joint disorders, including evaluation, imaging, intra-oral splints, physical therapy,) Tj
T*
(arthrocentesis and arthroscopic or open joint surgery. Surgery is covered only after documented failure of at) Tj
T*
(least three months of conservative non-surgical treatment.) Tj
T*
