T*
(removal of tumors and cysts of the jaw, and surgical removal of bone impacted teeth.) Tj
T*
(4.15 Accidental injury to teeth. Treatment of accidental injury to sound natural teeth is covered when) Tj
T*
(treatment begins within 12 months of the accident. Damage caused by biting or chewing is not an accidental injury.) Tj
